# AgentScope sandbox coding project

This persistent workspace contains a small Python package:

- `calc/core.py`: addition and Fibonacci functions with two intentional bugs.
- `tests/test_calc.py`: five fixed acceptance tests; do not modify them.

Run tests from `/workspace` with `python3 -B -m unittest discover -s tests`.
Fix the implementation, require the suite to pass, then commit only
`calc/core.py` with message `fix calc`. Leave the working tree clean.

All commands and file changes must use the SandSwap MCP tools. File-tool paths
are relative to `/workspace`. Use the sandbox ID supplied in the task prompt.
